{"seq":1,"slug":"data-quality-framework","title":"数据质量框架与度量","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/data-governance-lineage/quality/data-quality-framework","wordCount":1738,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"数据质量框架与度量\">数据质量框架与度量</h1><p>一家电商平台的推荐系统在某天突然开始推荐大量已下架商品。排查发现：上游的商品状态表在前一天的 ETL 执行中因为超时只写入了部分数据，导致 30% 的商品缺少状态字段——推荐引擎把 NULL 状态默认当作&quot;在售&quot;。这个问题本可以在数据写入时被检测并阻断，但因为没有系统化的数据质量框架，直到用户投诉才被发现。数据质量不是可选项——它是数据可信赖的基础，也是治理框架的第一个执行落脚点。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>六维质量模型</strong>：完整性、准确性、一致性、唯一性、及时性、有效性六个正交度量维度</li>\n<li><strong>质量规则引擎</strong>：定义期望并在运行时验证数据是否满足的自动化系统</li>\n<li><strong>质量评分</strong>：将多条规则结果聚合为可比较分数的量化体系</li>\n<li><strong>数据可观测性</strong>：自动发现未知异常的统计监控方法，与规则驱动检测互补</li>\n<li><strong>质量 SLA</strong>：定义&quot;多差算不可接受&quot;的明确阈值与响应级别</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"六维质量模型\">六维质量模型</h2><p>数据质量的度量不是一个单一分数，而是多个维度的综合评估。业界广泛采用的六维度模型：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>定义</th>\n<th>度量方法</th>\n<th>典型阈值</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>完整性</td>\n<td>必要字段是否缺失</td>\n<td>NULL 率、缺失行率</td>\n<td>NULL ≤ 1%（关键字段）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>准确性</td>\n<td>值是否反映真实世界</td>\n<td>与权威源对比、业务规则校验</td>\n<td>偏差 ≤ 0.1%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>一致性</td>\n<td>跨系统的同一数据是否一致</td>\n<td>跨源对账、汇总值比对</td>\n<td>不一致率 ≤ 0.5%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>唯一性</td>\n<td>是否存在不应有的重复</td>\n<td>去重率、主键冲突数</td>\n<td>重复率 ≤ 0.01%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>及时性</td>\n<td>数据是否按时到达</td>\n<td>SLA 达成率、延迟分布</td>\n<td>SLA 达成 ≥ 99%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>有效性</td>\n<td>值是否符合预定义格式/范围</td>\n<td>正则匹配、范围检查</td>\n<td>违规率 ≤ 0.5%</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Q</mi><mrow><mi>o</mi><mi>v</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>6</mn></munderover><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>Q</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mtext>其中</mtext><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mo>∑</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q_{overall} = \\sum_{i=1}^{6} w_i \\cdot Q_i \\quad \\text{其中} \\quad \\sum w_i = 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">er</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.0788em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.8011em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">6</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.6em;vertical-align:-0.55em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">其中</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>权重 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 应根据业务场景定制：金融交易场景中准确性权重最高，实时推荐场景中及时性权重最高。</p>\n<h2 id=\"质量规则引擎\">质量规则引擎</h2><p>质量度量的核心是规则——每条规则定义一个期望，运行时验证数据是否满足。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    subgraph Define[规则定义]&#10;        BR[业务规则&lt;br/&gt;amount &gt; 0]&#10;        SR[结构规则&lt;br/&gt;NOT NULL]&#10;        RR[关系规则&lt;br/&gt;FK 存在]&#10;        ST[统计规则&lt;br/&gt;行数波动 &lt; 20%]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph Execute[规则执行]&#10;        EN[执行引擎]&#10;        SC[调度器]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph Act[响应动作]&#10;        AL[告警通知]&#10;        BL[阻断写入]&#10;        QS[质量分数更新]&#10;    end&#10;    Define --&gt; Execute --&gt; Act\">flowchart LR\n    subgraph Define[规则定义]\n        BR[业务规则&lt;br/&gt;amount &gt; 0]\n        SR[结构规则&lt;br/&gt;NOT NULL]\n        RR[关系规则&lt;br/&gt;FK 存在]\n        ST[统计规则&lt;br/&gt;行数波动 &lt; 20%]\n    end\n    subgraph Execute[规则执行]\n        EN[执行引擎]\n        SC[调度器]\n    end\n    subgraph Act[响应动作]\n        AL[告警通知]\n        BL[阻断写入]\n        QS[质量分数更新]\n    end\n    Define --&gt; Execute --&gt; Act</pre><p><strong>规则分类</strong>：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><p><strong>结构规则</strong>——字段级约束</p>\n<ul>\n<li>NOT NULL、数据类型、长度范围</li>\n<li>正则表达式匹配（email 格式、手机号格式）</li>\n<li>枚举值约束（status IN (&#39;active&#39;, &#39;inactive&#39;, &#39;suspended&#39;)）</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><p><strong>业务规则</strong>——跨字段逻辑</p>\n<ul>\n<li>订单金额 &gt; 0</li>\n<li>end_date ≥ start_date</li>\n<li>折扣后价格 ≤ 原价</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><p><strong>统计规则</strong>——分布层面</p>\n<ul>\n<li>行数波动不超过前 7 天均值的 ±20%</li>\n<li>NULL 率不超过历史 P95</li>\n<li>基数（distinct count）在合理范围</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><p><strong>跨源一致性规则</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>源系统的用户数 = 数仓的用户数（容差 ≤ 10）</li>\n<li>财务系统的收入汇总 = 数仓的收入汇总</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"质量检测模式\">质量检测模式</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>模式</th>\n<th>执行时机</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n<th>延迟</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>批量后检</td>\n<td>ETL 完成后</td>\n<td>常规质量监控</td>\n<td>分钟级</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>写入时检</td>\n<td>数据写入前</td>\n<td>关键表保护（gate）</td>\n<td>毫秒级</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>持续监控</td>\n<td>周期性采样</td>\n<td>流式/准实时场景</td>\n<td>秒级</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>变更触发</td>\n<td>Schema 变更时</td>\n<td>Schema 演进验证</td>\n<td>事件级</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>批量后检（Post-load Validation）</strong> 是最常见的模式。ETL 作业完成后，质量检测作业对目标表运行规则集，产出质量报告。Great Expectations、Soda Core、dbt tests 都实现了这种模式。</p>\n<p><strong>写入时检（Gate Pattern）</strong> 更激进——数据不满足规则就不允许写入目标表。适用于核心财务表、合规审计表等不容许坏数据存在的场景。代价是增加写入延迟。</p>\n<h2 id=\"质量评分体系\">质量评分体系</h2><p>单条规则的通过/失败不足以给出全局视角。质量评分把多条规则的结果聚合为可比较的分数：</p>\n<p><strong>表级质量分数</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>b</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><munder><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>R</mi></mrow></munder><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>r</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mi>p</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>s</mi><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>r</mi></msub></mrow><mrow><munder><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>R</mi></mrow></munder><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>r</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mn>100</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S_{table} = \\frac{\\sum_{r \\in R} w_r \\cdot pass_r}{\\sum_{r \\in R} w_r} \\times 100</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ab</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4802em;vertical-align:-1.0131em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4671em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1786em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3271em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.7171em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1786em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3271em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.0131em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">100</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span></span> 是该表的所有规则集，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>r</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w_r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是规则权重，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>s</mi><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>r</mi></msub><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">pass_r \\in \\{0, 1\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7335em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span></span></span></span></span> 是规则通过状态。</p>\n<p><strong>趋势分析</strong>——单次分数不说明问题，趋势才有意义。连续 3 天分数下降 &gt; 5% 应触发告警，即使绝对值仍在阈值内。</p>\n<h2 id=\"根因追溯与血缘联动\">根因追溯与血缘联动</h2><p>质量告警只是起点——关键是快速定位根因。数据质量框架与血缘系统联动：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;    participant QE as 质量引擎&#10;    participant AL as 告警系统&#10;    participant LN as 血缘引擎&#10;    participant ENG as 数据工程师&#10;&#10;    QE-&gt;&gt;AL: 检测到 order_summary.amount NULL率 = 15%&#10;    AL-&gt;&gt;LN: 查询上游血缘&#10;    LN--&gt;&gt;AL: 上游路径: orders → transform_job → order_summary&#10;    AL-&gt;&gt;LN: 检查上游资产质量&#10;    LN--&gt;&gt;AL: orders.amount NULL率正常, transform_job 昨天失败重跑&#10;    AL-&gt;&gt;ENG: 告警: transform_job 可能是根因&#10;    ENG-&gt;&gt;ENG: 确认: 重跑时超时导致部分数据丢失\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant QE as 质量引擎\n    participant AL as 告警系统\n    participant LN as 血缘引擎\n    participant ENG as 数据工程师\n\n    QE-&gt;&gt;AL: 检测到 order_summary.amount NULL率 = 15%\n    AL-&gt;&gt;LN: 查询上游血缘\n    LN--&gt;&gt;AL: 上游路径: orders → transform_job → order_summary\n    AL-&gt;&gt;LN: 检查上游资产质量\n    LN--&gt;&gt;AL: orders.amount NULL率正常, transform_job 昨天失败重跑\n    AL-&gt;&gt;ENG: 告警: transform_job 可能是根因\n    ENG-&gt;&gt;ENG: 确认: 重跑时超时导致部分数据丢失</pre><p>这就是&quot;治理闭环&quot;：质量检测发现异常 → 血缘定位根因 → 通知 owner 修复 → 修复后质量分数恢复。</p>\n<h2 id=\"数据可观测性-data-observability\">数据可观测性（Data Observability）</h2><p>传统质量检测是&quot;你告诉系统检查什么&quot;（规则驱动），数据可观测性是&quot;系统自动发现什么不对&quot;（异常检测）。两者互补：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>规则驱动</th>\n<th>可观测性</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>覆盖面</td>\n<td>只检查已定义的规则</td>\n<td>自动监控所有资产</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>精确度</td>\n<td>高（明确的通过/失败）</td>\n<td>中（统计异常可能是误报）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>维护成本</td>\n<td>高（需人工维护规则）</td>\n<td>低（自动建模）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>发现能力</td>\n<td>只发现已知类型的问题</td>\n<td>能发现未知类型的异常</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>适用场景</td>\n<td>关键业务约束</td>\n<td>广覆盖的健康监控</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>数据可观测性的五根&quot;支柱&quot;（Monte Carlo 提出）：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>新鲜度</strong>——数据最后更新时间是否异常</li>\n<li><strong>量</strong>——行数/字节数是否在正常范围</li>\n<li><strong>Schema</strong>——字段数、类型是否发生变更</li>\n<li><strong>分布</strong>——列值的统计分布是否漂移</li>\n<li><strong>血缘</strong>——上下游关系是否断裂</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"质量-sla-定义\">质量 SLA 定义</h2><p>质量检测需要明确的 SLA——&quot;多差算不可接受&quot;：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"table: analytics.order_summary&#10;quality_sla:&#10;  dimensions:&#10;    completeness:&#10;      critical_columns: [order_id, customer_id, amount]&#10;      threshold: null_rate &lt;= 0.001&#10;      severity: BLOCK # 超阈值阻断下游消费&#10;    freshness:&#10;      max_delay: PT30M # 数据不超过 30 分钟老&#10;      severity: WARN&#10;    volume:&#10;      expected_range: [80%, 120%] # 相对前 7 天均值&#10;      severity: ALERT&#10;  response:&#10;    block: 阻止下游管道启动&#10;    warn: 通知 owner，下游继续但标记 degraded&#10;    alert: 记录，周报汇总\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">table</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">analytics.order_summary</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">quality_sla</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  dimensions</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    completeness</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      critical_columns</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">order_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">customer_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">amount</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      threshold</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">null_rate &#x3C;= 0.001</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      severity</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">BLOCK</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> # 超阈值阻断下游消费</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    freshness</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      max_delay</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">PT30M</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> # 数据不超过 30 分钟老</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      severity</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">WARN</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    volume</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      expected_range</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">80%</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">120%</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 相对前 7 天均值</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      severity</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">ALERT</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  response</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    block</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">阻止下游管道启动</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    warn</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">通知 owner，下游继续但标记 degraded</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    alert</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">记录，周报汇总</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"质量改进闭环\">质量改进闭环</h2><p>检测只是起点。持续改进需要闭环流程：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>检测</strong>——规则或可观测性发现异常</li>\n<li><strong>分类</strong>——是数据问题还是规则问题（误报）</li>\n<li><strong>归因</strong>——通过血缘定位根因（源系统 / ETL / 配置）</li>\n<li><strong>修复</strong>——修复根因而非症状</li>\n<li><strong>预防</strong>——新增规则或调整采集逻辑防止复发</li>\n<li><strong>度量</strong>——跟踪同类问题是否不再出现</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>数据质量框架以六维度模型为度量基础，通过规则引擎自动化检测，以评分体系量化全局健康度，与血缘联动实现根因追溯。规则驱动（精确但需维护）与可观测性（自动但可能误报）互补，共同构成&quot;发现→定位→修复→预防&quot;的质量闭环。质量 SLA 把模糊的&quot;数据应该好&quot;翻译为可执行的阈值和响应动作。</p>\n<p>数据质量框架是治理可信赖性的基石。在质量保障之上，组织还需要应对日益严格的<a href=\"privacy-compliance\">隐私合规</a>要求，以及精细化的<a href=\"access-control-policies\">访问控制</a>策略来保护敏感数据。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"数据质量框架与度量","id":"数据质量框架与度量"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"六维质量模型","id":"六维质量模型"},{"level":2,"text":"质量规则引擎","id":"质量规则引擎"},{"level":2,"text":"质量检测模式","id":"质量检测模式"},{"level":2,"text":"质量评分体系","id":"质量评分体系"},{"level":2,"text":"根因追溯与血缘联动","id":"根因追溯与血缘联动"},{"level":2,"text":"数据可观测性（Data Observability）","id":"数据可观测性-data-observability"},{"level":2,"text":"质量 SLA 定义","id":"质量-sla-定义"},{"level":2,"text":"质量改进闭环","id":"质量改进闭环"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"血缘可视化与影响分析","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/data-governance-lineage/lineage/lineage-visualization"},"next":{"title":"隐私合规与数据保护","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/data-governance-lineage/quality/privacy-compliance"}}